From 9797611e9907f63e0649f5ee0bec7cf31634499a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 05:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Skylines page: every city's skylines in place, all cities at
 one scale

One unframed box per city, its skyline extents drawn where they stand
(north up, the map taken away), with the city's towers as dots, and every
city at one shared scale: at Fit the city that spreads widest fills the
column, and 2x/4x/8x zoom in (wide cities scroll inside their own box).
Each box carries a sticker with the city, its skylines' names, towers of
150 m+ inside, total area and tallest tower; sort by area, towers, tallest
or city. Skylines are found at build time from public/skyline-extent.geojson
with the density rule of build_density.py. Top bar gains a Skylines link.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QEw7jWCRyhcdfinpRjVmuQ
